6. Upgrade the Bluetooth 5.0 chip, the performance is improved, 10 meters is not stuck &amp; continuous;
8. Squeeze sensor;
9. Call to listen to songs for 3+ hours, long battery life;
10. Out of the box automatic boot / automatic pairing;

